# Cron line for garden-water — evening run, then the program exits.
# Install with:  crontab -e   (adjust the three paths)
#
# 19:00 is the SERVER's timezone; "today"/"tomorrow" inside the program use
# the garden timezone from config.yaml (location.timezone).
# .env, config.yaml and garden.db resolve next to garden_water.py, so cron's
# working directory does not matter.

0 19 * * * /path/to/garden-water/.venv/bin/python /path/to/garden-water/garden_water.py >> /path/to/garden-water/garden-water.log 2>&1

# Optional: nightly cleanup of old history (see README §Pruning old records).
# Keeps the last 30 days of weather_daily + watering_decisions; never touches
# reminder_state or provider_status. No Telegram, no weather fetch, exit 0.
15 20 * * * /path/to/garden-water/.venv/bin/python /path/to/garden-water/garden_water.py --prune >> /path/to/garden-water/garden-water.log 2>&1
